Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spines that this mask\Nuses can pierce a human brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.34,0:00:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, they don't yet have the\Nstrength to probe our immortal brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.26,0:00:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The solution is finding more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, what's that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mortals call it the Red Stone of Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power is of a particular\Ninterest for our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.96,0:00:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little stone can refract\Nlight at least a billion times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end result is light of\Nincredible purity and strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.96,0:00:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This amplified light holds power untold.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.32,0:00:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this one won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This little red pebble isn't large enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need more capacity and strength in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To complete our mask, we need a red\Nstone that is large and utterly flawless.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a super Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.54,0:01:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we have that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we will conquer the sun and then become\Nthe final perfect step in evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.50,0:01:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The masks were invented by the oldest\Npillar man among them, and his name is Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.56,0:01:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cars ACDC and Mama cross the Atlantic in\Ntheir search for a suitable Super Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are, Susie Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Signora, here, just like you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.86,0:01:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.46,0:01:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.78,0:01:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I have in my hand here is a\Nnatural, perfectly flawless stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.22,0:01:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Super Asia. Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been carrying the\Nred stone of Asia around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warriors of Harmon were\Nwiped out by the Pillar Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.68,0:01:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stone narrowly avoided being taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.34,0:02:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I have been given\Nthe honor to be its guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, I know exactly how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stone masks not only\Nkilled our grandfathers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they took the lives of\Ncountless others as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we've met its creator, Kars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just break it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.24,0:02:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, crush the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smash it to pieces and\Nthey'll cry like babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.42,0:02:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I can't do that. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.36,0:02:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's stopping you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Legend says the Pillamen can't be defeated
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.50,0:02:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless the stone is somehow a part\Nof the process. What? That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.58,0:02:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will perform my duty\Nas guardian as best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, Caesar, I'm afraid it's\Nnecessary for a final examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.15,0:02:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A final exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.18,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar, take on Machina and defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:56.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you have the same\Nassignment but with logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two ready?
