Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.92,0:04:35.55,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,680)\pos(1275,865)}Episode 17: "The Deeper Plan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always darkest then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.70,0:04:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, where could I\Nexpect Logs to be hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp, Joseph. Eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got a score to settle with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.60,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that Instructor Logs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.72,0:05:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Horrible! Unnatural!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.70,0:05:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Logs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.64,0:05:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you came to Venice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Came here to this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that the woman guarding the stone\Nis merely an island or two over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His lungs were pulled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lungs are vital for Harmon users.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It had to have been a\Nkick of incredible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.28,0:05:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The tyrant logs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You yelled at me for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.52,0:06:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were relentless\Nwith your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I hated you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sure that this would be my chance to\Nget you back for everything you did to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll have to watch me from where you are
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.56,0:06:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now instructor see what\Ni've learned from you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hey acedisi i know it's\Nsix days early but i'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take it now that antidote\Nin your nose ring is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, boy. I don't\Nhave the time to deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.38,0:06:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with you you don't have\Nthe time what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean you have a lot more\Ntime than i do that was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty sharp you may have\Na little more to offer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when someone looks at me with\Nan obvious challenge like that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are asking for their death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this one\Nmore time. Back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that with one touch of my hand,\Nyou'll soon be missing half of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try to move me.
