Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.37,0:07:15.41,SFXYellow,2,0,0,0,,{=24}{\blur0.8\bord0\fscx122.96\fscy102.47\alpha&H00&\frz342.5\pos(1149.53,534.4)\4a&HFF&}Block
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this now? Oh, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.14,0:07:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only move for important\Nthings, like dog poo in my path.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his hamon, he's able to break\Nright through the flesh of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's learned a great deal of control\Nin a very short period of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.76,0:07:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've developed new skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.08,0:07:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say I'm rather surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're still far from\Nready to fight someone like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've met and devoured countless Hamon\Nusers like you thousands of years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:08:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I twist your finger completely off,\Nyou'll never use it for Hamon ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you finally noticed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your arm is wrapped up in\Na loop of fine silk thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's soaked in vegetable oil, so it\Nreally conducts Hamon quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit I was aiming for your neck,\Nbut you didn't give me the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could a mortal have done this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually a little morbid for my taste,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but still first blood goes\Nto me and my instructor. Ah!
