Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2,500 years ago in China,\Na man wrote The Art of War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.96,0:08:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said this, victory is decided\Nbefore the battle is fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means if you plan to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need to lay out strategies\Nwhile your opponent is unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:06.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that I skipped school a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Granny Iran made darn\Nsure I studied my history.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So while you may have a lot\Nof years under your belt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you didn't leave any room\Nin your head for strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.36,0:09:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
