Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.46,0:09:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.74,0:09:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you upset that I\Ndisintegrated your widow arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then, get upset!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.12,0:09:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm far more furious than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:43.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of that little ring you\Nsaw fit to put inside my neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't slept right for weeks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.08,0:09:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:10:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's bawling his eyes out, and I\Nthought he'd go on a bloody rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more than weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's throwing a tantrum\Nlike some three-year-old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My poor arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.78,0:10:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some things are creepier\Nthan mindless anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should finish him off quickly.
