Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes my emotions overwhelm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I'm about to lose it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I try to calm myself down by\Nventing with a crying jag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:11:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earlier you referred\Nto Sun Tzu, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew him personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long ago, I journeyed to China to study.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To fight us to delude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All war is deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One tries to make their\Nenemies angry in order
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to lure them into\Ncommitting costly mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is precisely what you're\Nplanning on, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I must say, Jojo, I really\Nam shocked at your improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.16,0:11:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire your Hamon ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been longing for a worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
