Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.94,0:11:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it is a bit thin at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it'll grow thicker\Nwith the passage of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a minute ago, he was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I just frighten you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're frightened a lot, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.36,0:11:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't read him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been able to read my opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then use their own\Nfeelings against them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this guy's personality is beyond me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the one who's being read here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to Log's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.64,0:12:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body, it's boiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An animal's core temperature\Nwill increase when
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its fighting disease are\Ngreatly exerting itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can raise my blood up to 500\Ndegrees and then shoot it out at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.68,0:12:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time, I took off his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also sent in some of my\Nboiling blood to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.96,0:12:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With his divine sandstorm,\NWamuu can control the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My domain is that of heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I control the inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grant that your power to destroy\Na defenseless, dead body is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.82,0:13:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can also see that the reason\Nyou did it was to try and scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now try a clack of volley!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hormone isn't like it was a month ago!
