Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.04,0:13:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really did frighten you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, Jojo,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your uncontrolled emotions caused you\Nto attack me recklessly and too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.78,0:13:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My veins will inject boiling\Nblood into your skull
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then turn your brain\Ninto a nice red stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the reason that I am\Ncalled the Burning King! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.34,0:13:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah! Gah! Gah! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.66,0:13:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SEASUR, TAKE THIS!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ABOLUNCHE!
