Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SEASUR, STOP!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:01.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we continue this contest,\None or both of us will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.00,0:14:10.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And much as my ego doesn't want\Nto admit it, I'd be the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For nearly ten years more than\Nyou, I've been in preparation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But today, your hormone\Nattack was so focused,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were able to burn\Nthe hair off of my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.32,0:14:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else can I do after\Nbeing shamed like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have passed your final\Nexam with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should feel a sense of pride for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you more interested in how your\Ngood-for-nothing friend is doing in his exam,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caesar?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.60,0:14:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I had\Nthe power I did in this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.34,0:14:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,training is that I wanted\Nto match Jojo's talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.24,0:15:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, we're both going to survive\Nthe trials being presented to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.70,0:15:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo seems lazy and impudent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.46,0:15:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But deep down, he's\Nworth having as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not so good at making\Nfriends for yourself, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when you do, it's true love, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's another of those\Nclever dodges of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.86,0:15:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mask gave me some\Nprotection that time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn him and his blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, oh man,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.50,0:15:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally have the chance for these sexy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lips to come out from\Nunder that rotten mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the first thing you do,\Nyou bastard, is burn them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, hmm, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.88,0:15:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the surface you make witty banter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.10,0:16:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But inside your head you're making\Nall sorts of plans, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went pale, Jojo. Did I hit the mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I anywhere close to the bullseye?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:14.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My next plan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, yes, I'll use the string.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.28,0:16:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll act like I'm dodging\Nto get away from him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but all the time I'll be running a string\Nalong these spikes with each move I make.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.22,0:16:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let him catch on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.02,0:16:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once he steps inside the string,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll wrap him up in it, then use\Nmy hormone to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That laugh means trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could he be reading my plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.76,0:17:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here is the Burning King's prison!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.84,0:17:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long can you possibly keep\Navoiding my attacks, Jojo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess you finally noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what possible reason\Nwould my hat be shrieking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You appear to be caught in my well.
