Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hat is made of 100 % wool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It conducts harmon very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're smiling again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing about this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next words from your mouth are,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to knock that\Nsmirk right off of your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to knock that\Nsmirk right off your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, you can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you had a web?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.50,0:17:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look around, I am the one with the web.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew exactly what you had in mind with\Nyour little plan even before you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.78,0:17:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Jojo, what was that\Nphrase you said earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.32,0:18:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like victory is decided before\Nthe battle is fought, was that what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How incredibly true were\Nthe words you spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But my plans were the ones to go deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:19.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My plans were the ones to decide victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like my veins have created\Nsome little holes on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.04,0:18:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now I'll fill every one of them\Nwith a generous portion of my boiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burning blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.12,0:18:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll look like a lovely birthday\Ncake covered in candles flickering?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.56,0:18:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with their merry little red flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's on the knife's edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going to make it. Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from what I can see, we have\Nto assume that Logs has been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Jojo is not the one to survive, we will\Nbe the ones AC/DC will come after next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo is too far away for us\Nto be able to help him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.04,0:18:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's painful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:19:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but right now we have to think about\Nprotecting Lisa Lisa and the Red Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come, let's make our preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me hear your screams as you twitch\Nand writhe in despair and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowing that you lost today, Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really laughing as I'm about\Nto deal you an excruciating death?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been driven\Ncompletely insane by the fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:35.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.42,0:19:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll notice my arms are\Nfolded and my eyes are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so this laugh would be one of victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,AC/DC,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the loser here today\Nbecause for the last 2,000 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have been asleep at the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.90,0:19:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that? Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't read me as clearly\Nas you thought you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me help you understand just\Nhow badly you've underestimated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that your plans went deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.82,0:20:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they didn't go\Nnearly as deep as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.42,0:20:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While you were snoozing for the past\N2,000 years, humans have progressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.78,0:20:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,During the 18th and 19th centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.62,0:20:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leisure de main, or sleight of hand, became\Na very popular form of entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a really big fan of it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Illusion is my thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.42,0:20:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I cut all those strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
