Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.02,0:21:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ACDC's body is shooting\Nsome kind of strange energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must come from living for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.14,0:21:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die with the power of life you stole\Nfrom thousands of innocent human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.26,0:21:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My instructor, I thank\Nyou for torturing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mille Crazy to you, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.38,0:22:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we defeated San Viento in the\Nwell, his entire body turned into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.44,0:22:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even AC/DC's bones\Nwere completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so different?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.22,0:22:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe it's because my harmon is\Nso much stronger than it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's dead now, and I have one of\Nthe antidotes I've been chasing down.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.33,0:22:33.37,SFXWhite,13,0,0,0,,{=43}{\blur0.7\alpha&HFF&\frz8.075\pos(934.45,899.45)\c&H4D2D39&}Droop {This means that the drip is of a thicker liquid, like snot, but I cant find the right word for it.} {I'll go with droop this time}
