Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, this reminds me of snot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it's just because it's stripping\Nfrom a ring that came out of his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I need to knock it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do think it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.94,0:23:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ring around my windpipe is\Ngone and I can breathe free again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, now I'll go see Caesar and Lisa Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think maybe I was using my\Nhead too much in that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.14,0:23:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My shoulders are really kind of stiff.
